Subject: [PATCH 116/202] [ae-patch] Show what a session is doing now in its
 sidebar hover card

The hover card gains a status block under the title, read from the row's own
state: the current step while working or quiet, the open question or the step
awaiting approval while it waits on the user, each running agent's newest step,
or the last reply once idle. Details load only while the card is open.
